Error [jet.DriverOperationFailed]: Can't find the Jet toolchain sources: `JET_TOOLCHAIN_ROOT` is not set, no directory at or above `{work}/app/hello.jet` holds `Core/` and `Compiler/Prelude/`, and `{work}/tool` beside jet holds no installed toolchain
 Why: Jet could not complete the named file, tool, or operating-system operation
 Fix: Set `JET_TOOLCHAIN_ROOT` to the Jet toolchain source tree, run jet on a file inside a Jet checkout, or install the toolchain beside jet
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E2105
